This C program fulfills the user's request by interfacing with an ADXL335 accelerometer via an MCP3008 ADC on Raspberry Pi 4 Model B using the pigpio library. It logs the X, Y, Z raw ADC values to `impact_log.txt` at 100 Hz, computes the acceleration magnitude, flags impacts exceeding 2.0g, and handles errors and resources properly. The program also terminates gracefully on receiving a SIGINT signal (Ctrl+C).

