This C program reads the temperature from an LM35 sensor connected to an MCP3008 ADC via SPI on a Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+, using the `pigpio` library. It logs the temperature readings to the console and writes them to a binary file `temp_log.dat` every 5 seconds, maintaining a circular buffer of 120 float entries. The program handles SIGINT and SIGTERM signals by closing resources and exiting cleanly.

