This C program uses the `pigpio` library to control GPIO pins and the `libgpiod` library for I2C operations on a Raspberry Pi 4 Model B. It monitors a VL53L1X time-of-flight sensor via I2C bus 1 at address 0x29 and controls a gate actuator based on the sensor's readings. The program opens a log file to record gate open/close events with ISO 8601 UTC timestamps and handles all necessary error checks and resource releases on exit paths.

