This C program initializes the pigpio library on a Raspberry Pi, communicates with a TDK InvenSense MPU-6050 accelerometer and gyroscope over I2C bus 1, reads raw data, and prints it to the console. It handles initialization, error checking, and resource cleanup properly. The program also handles SIGINT and SIGTERM signals by cleaning up resources before exiting.

