The code uses the `pigpio` library for GPIO and I2C operations, ensuring compatibility with modern Raspberry Pi models. It includes error checking for all critical operations and releases resources properly on exit. The BMP180 compensation algorithm is implemented using integer arithmetic, avoiding floating-point operations as requested.

